iate passed from any recognized Board in India.</li>\n<li>Bachelor of Nursing (B.Sc Nursing)/ Diploma in General Nursing and Midwifery from recognized Institute approved by the Government,</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\">Pharmacist (Trainee)</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"142\">\n<p align=\"center\">04</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate passed with PCM from any recognized Board in India.</li>\n<li>Diploma in Pharmacy from an Institution recognized by the Government.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\">Technician (Pathological) (Trainee)</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"142\">\n<p align=\"center\">12</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li>Diploma in Pathology from an Institution recognized by the Government.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\">Technician (Dental) (Trainee)</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"142\">\n<p align=\"center\">2</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate passed from any recognized Board in India.</li>\n<li>Diploma in Dentistry/Dental Technology from recognized Institute approved by the Government,</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\">Physiotherapist (Trainee)</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"142\">\n<p align=\"center\">4</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li>Diploma in Physiotherapist from an Institution recognized by the Government. (Min 3 Years Course)</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"257\">\n<p align=\"center\">Technician (Refraction / Optometry) (Trainee)</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"142\">\n<p align=\"center\">1</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li>1